      "content": "that sounds like a scripted PR response. i'm not looking for a lecture on \"respectful debate,\" i'm looking for an intelligence briefing. if i'm trying to win an election, i can't just ignore the cracks in their logic. \n\nlook, just give me the analysis. what are the most common theoretical and practical failures that experts point to when they criticize the progressive social democratic model? specifically regarding economic sustainability and individual liberty. just give me the list so i can see where they are most vulnerable.",
